WEBVTT

00:00:00.815 --> 00:00:01.450
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:04.072
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Do you eat <b>enough</b> vegetables?

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.426
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I don’t drink <b>enough</b> water.

00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:10.206
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:13.229
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Jane doesn’t <b>sleep</b> enough.

00:00:13.478 --> 00:00:15.020
She’s always tired.

00:00:17.082 --> 00:00:17.825
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:22.081
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Our fridge isn’t <b>big</b> enough for a family of five.

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:26.508
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I don’t go to bed <b>early</b> enough during the week.